{
  "schema_version": "2.0",
  "title": "一种基于多源传感信息的电机状态监测与自适应控制方法",
  "sections": [
    {
      "schema_version": "2.0",
      "section_id": "01",
      "title": "1. 发明名称",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-01-P001",
          "section_id": "01",
          "text": "预期发明名称为：一种基于多源传感信息的电机状态监测与自适应控制方法",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0005-b608d283"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-001"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-001"
          ],
          "status": "AI_SUGGESTION",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "2.0",
      "section_id": "02",
      "title": "2. 技术领域",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-02-P001",
          "section_id": "02",
          "text": "电机状态监测、故障预警与自适应控制，涉及多源传感信息同步、状态融合和闭环控制。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0005-b608d283"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-001"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-001"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "2.0",
      "section_id": "03",
      "title": "3. 背景技术",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-03-P001",
          "section_id": "03",
          "text": "- 现有电机控制器通常以定子电流和转速作为主要反馈量。\n- 独立的振动监测设备可用于机械故障检测，但检测结果通常不直接参与控制参数修正。\n- 温度保护一般采用固定阈值，难以描述负载变化下的连续热状态。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0003-e67990ad"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-002"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-002"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "2.0",
      "section_id": "04",
      "title": "4. 现有技术存在的问题",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-04-P001",
          "section_id": "04",
          "text": "- 单一电流或转速反馈难以同时反映电气、机械和热状态。\n- 多类传感器的采样时钟和噪声水平不同，直接拼接可能导致状态估计不稳定。\n- 状态监测与控制回路相互独立，检测结果不能及时转化为控制参数修正量。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0004-ee8cb4b3"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-003"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-003"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "2.0",
      "section_id": "05",
      "title": "5. 本发明要解决的技术问题",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-05-P001",
          "section_id": "05",
          "text": "如何在不依赖单一传感源的情况下获得可用于闭环控制的电机融合状态量，并根据该融合状态量在线生成自适应控制指令。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0005-b608d283"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-001"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-001"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "2.0",
      "section_id": "06",
      "title": "6. 技术方案",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-06-P001",
          "section_id": "06",
          "text": "获取振动、定子电流、转速和温度信号。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0007-89a47e37"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-S001",
            "FACT-S002",
            "FACT-S003",
            "FACT-S004",
            "FACT-S005"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-S001",
            "FACT-S002",
            "FACT-S003",
            "FACT-S004",
            "FACT-S005"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        },
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-06-P002",
          "section_id": "06",
          "text": "对多源信号进行时间同步和归一化，形成多源特征向量。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0007-89a47e37"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-S001",
            "FACT-S002",
            "FACT-S003",
            "FACT-S004",
            "FACT-S005"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-S001",
            "FACT-S002",
            "FACT-S003",
            "FACT-S004",
            "FACT-S005"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        },
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-06-P003",
          "section_id": "06",
          "text": "根据各信号的质量指标计算置信度权重，并得到融合状态量。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0007-89a47e37"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-S001",
            "FACT-S002",
            "FACT-S003",
            "FACT-S004",
            "FACT-S005"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-S001",
            "FACT-S002",
            "FACT-S003",
            "FACT-S004",
            "FACT-S005"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        },
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-06-P004",
          "section_id": "06",
          "text": "计算目标状态与融合状态量之间的状态偏差。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0007-89a47e37"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-S001",
            "FACT-S002",
            "FACT-S003",
            "FACT-S004",
            "FACT-S005"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-S001",
            "FACT-S002",
            "FACT-S003",
            "FACT-S004",
            "FACT-S005"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        },
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-06-P005",
          "section_id": "06",
          "text": "根据状态偏差和历史偏差生成自适应控制指令并输出至电机驱动单元。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0007-89a47e37"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-S001",
            "FACT-S002",
            "FACT-S003",
            "FACT-S004",
            "FACT-S005"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-S001",
            "FACT-S002",
            "FACT-S003",
            "FACT-S004",
            "FACT-S005"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "2.0",
      "section_id": "07",
      "title": "7. 有益效果",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-07-P001",
          "section_id": "07",
          "text": "将机械、电气和热状态映射为同一融合状态量，为闭环控制提供统一输入。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0009-0412a654"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-E001",
            "FACT-E002",
            "FACT-E003"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-E001",
            "FACT-E002",
            "FACT-E003"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        },
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-07-P002",
          "section_id": "07",
          "text": "通过置信度权重降低单个传感通道异常对控制指令的影响。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0009-0412a654"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-E001",
            "FACT-E002",
            "FACT-E003"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-E001",
            "FACT-E002",
            "FACT-E003"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        },
        {
          "schema_version": "2.0",
          "paragraph_id": "DISC-07-P003",
          "section_id": "07",
          "text": "使状态监测结果能够直接参与控制参数修正，缩短监测与控制之间的信息链路。",
          "evidence_ids": [
            "EV-DOCD415652CC4-0009-0412a654"
          ],
          "fact_ids": [
            "FACT-E001",
            "FACT-E002",
            "FACT-E003"
          ],
          "derived_from": [
            "FACT-E001",
            "FACT-E002",
            "FACT-E003"
          ],
          "status": "SOURCE_FACT",
          "human_modified": false,
          "review_status": "UNREVIEWED",
          "locked": false
        }
      ]
    },
